data/*.log
data/analytics_agentic/checkpoint_*.json
data/analytics_report_*.html
data/demo_screenshot.png

# Shared-memory / drift tooling scratch (local-only, never published)
.pattern-capture-queue/
.prd-sync-pending-*.md

# Editor + tool backups
*.bak
